# Cursor adapter environment — identity + memory switches ONLY.
# NO CREDENTIAL VALUES in this file, ever. Since realignment stage C9 there is
# no provider URL and no memory bearer on any surface: memory is the canonical
# l9-graphite-memory control plane (ops/memory), bound per checkout by
# ops/config/memory-binding.json, and its runtime resolves its own credentials
# (memory ADR-016). Identity SSOT: environment/agents/agent_registry.yaml
# (agents.cursor).

# --- identity trio (registry: agents.cursor) ---------------------------------
L9_MEMORY_AGENT_ID=cursor
USER_ID=cursor_agent
L9_GOVERNANCE_SURFACE=cursor

# --- memory control plane -----------------------------------------------------
# L9_MEMORY_INTERPRETER is optional: the Python that carries the pinned
# l9-graphite-memory package. When unset the governance interpreter is probed
# (ops/memory/runtime_binding.py). ~/.cursor/mcp.json is rendered by
# `make memory-mcp-install`; the memory entry is written by the package.
# L9_MEMORY_INTERPRETER=

# --- switches (machine-local ~/.cursor/graphiti.env until C11) ----------------
# L9_MEMORY_ENABLED=1        (legacy name GRAPHITI_MEMORY_ENABLED honored)
# L9_MEMORY_WRITE_GATES=0    (legacy name GRAPHITI_WRITE_GATES honored)
